-DosBeep validates frequency 37..32767 and duration <=60000 ms, starts a bounded native Beep worker and sleeps only the calling guest thread for the requested duration. Jobs retain no Runtime pointer. Playback is best-effort, not a hardware-completion guarantee. Muted sound was reported but audio is audible. A persistent synthesized PCM backend is future work, not part of this milestone.
